><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can download the official exam timetable from the UPSC website under the\u00a0<strong data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"613\">What\u2019s New</strong>\u00a0or CDS II examination section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"698\">What are the exam timings for UPSC CDS II 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>The\u00a0English\u00a0paper will be held from\u00a09:00 AM to 11:00 AM,\u00a0General Knowledge\u00a0from\u00a012:30 PM to 2:30 PM, and\u00a0Elementary Mathematics\u00a0from\u00a04:00 PM to 6:00 PM.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>UPSC</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <b>UPSC </b>is <strong>https://upsc.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div></div>\n<p><img alt=\"UPSC CDS-II Exam Schedule 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-39661 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-13T120630.789-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-13T120630.789-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-13T120630.789-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-13T120630.789-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari